{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08865","headline":"寄远十一首 八 · 李白","name":"寄远十一首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨东园桃李红碧枝，与君此时初别离。\n金瓶落井无消息，令人行叹复坐思。\n坐思行叹成楚越，春风玉颜畏销歇。\n碧窗纷纷下落花，青楼寂寂空明月。\n两不见，但相思，空留锦字表心素，至今缄愁不忍窥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}